"Build the six remaining deliverable units of ShikhokPlus (D1-D6), per the approved re-cut plan at aidlc/spaces/default/intents/261016-shikhokplus-tuition-app/inception/delivery-planning/bolt-plan.md. Four Units are already built and merged (money-core, api-contract, identity-and-access, batches-and-enrollment); this work covers only what remains, cut as vertical slices where each unit is one user-visible capability with its API, screens and tests together, and is not done until the thing can be done on a phone. D1 signing-up-and-joining: account creation plus seat acceptance, which no Bolt covered and which closes the gap where a teacher typing a phone number grants a guardian lens with no consent. D2 running-a-batch: screens over existing endpoints, plus the guardian child view. D3 collecting-fees: fee cycles, ledger, payment claims and verification. D4 teaching-and-recording: sessions, attendance with the offline conflict path, exams and marksheets. D5 knowing-how-it-is-going: teacher insights plus the outstanding Macrobenchmark harness. D6 releasing-safely: privacy, governance, both account-deletion paths, release-blocking. Construction runs autonomously."
